    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sneak-A-Snap</strong> is a stealthy, anime-inspired sandbox adventure where your camera is your weapon, timing is your skill, and your goal? Capture the perfect shot\u2026 without getting caught.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a photography amateur with artistic ambitions and a not-so-innocent eye for detail. With your camera in hand and a city full of beautiful girls, you set out to build your portfolio\u2014one steamy snapshot at a time. Whether it\u2019s candid moments in public spaces or carefully orchestrated setups, every shot is a new challenge... and a new reward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630270/extras/3badbb600f0bbf470d3d54080873256b.poster.avif?t=1746557519\" width=620 height=460 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630270/extras/3badbb600f0bbf470d3d54080873256b.webm?t=1746557519\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blend into your environment, manipulate objects, and engineer perfect photo ops\u2014all while staying hidden (or playing dumb when you're not). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630270/extras/af1b3c06c7de6d4b6321cfc3641734db.poster.avif?t=1746557519\" width=620 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630270/extras/af1b3c06c7de6d4b6321cfc3641734db.webm?t=1746557519\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your photo collection gains popularity, requests from your online followers get... more specific. It\u2019s up to you how far you\u2019re willing to go for the perfect snap.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sneak-A-Snap</strong> is a stealthy, anime-inspired sandbox adventure where your camera is your weapon, timing is your skill, and your goal? Capture the perfect shot\u2026 without getting caught.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a photography amateur with artistic ambitions and a not-so-innocent eye for detail. With your camera in hand and a city full of beautiful girls, you set out to build your portfolio\u2014one steamy snapshot at a time. Whether it\u2019s candid moments in public spaces or carefully orchestrated setups, every shot is a new challenge... and a new reward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630270/extras/3badbb600f0bbf470d3d54080873256b.poster.avif?t=1746557519\" width=620 height=460 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630270/extras/3badbb600f0bbf470d3d54080873256b.webm?t=1746557519\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blend into your environment, manipulate objects, and engineer perfect photo ops\u2014all while staying hidden (or playing dumb when you're not). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630270/extras/af1b3c06c7de6d4b6321cfc3641734db.poster.avif?t=1746557519\" width=620 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630270/extras/af1b3c06c7de6d4b6321cfc3641734db.webm?t=1746557519\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your photo collection gains popularity, requests from your online followers get... more specific. It\u2019s up to you how far